{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-06_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-06","title":"灾难","storyCode":"1-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"3ebb45120b5e540deb1dbd4194f22e13db2590fdc3fdca0099949ca131fc52eb","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"一个女人站在高楼之上，将博士一行的奋战收入眼底。\n随后，在她唱诗般的言语中，天空陷入血色。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第九关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，他们不知道自己被浮士德跟踪。我从浮士德派回来的斥候那里了解到了一些情报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛确实被困在中城区的外围了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然是些虫子，但他们也可能趁着天灾带来混乱逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"以他们对切尔诺伯格现状的了解，说不定会干扰到我们的计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"——至少，把他们铲除掉没有任何坏处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"切尔诺伯格的混蛋，都是你们，都是你们，害得我们感染者变成这样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"闪开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"呜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"这些人，只不过是在前仆后继地送死！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动怎么全都陷入了狂躁状态？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么这个时候，这里会聚集着这么多整合运动？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"不合常理！整合运动根本没有坚守这里的理由！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛干员们，不要退缩！击退整合运动，打开撤退路径！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"那些人就是情报中说的“罗德岛”？呵......很英勇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......落石？这个时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"别停下！优先确保防线！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"不对......是砸在建筑物上迸出来的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"来了！来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......我们感染者的救赎！普通人的末日！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊啊——咕！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊啊——咕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"他是被什么东西......击倒的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你们有谁......攻击了他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，他是被......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"杜宾！天空......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"天空陷入了血色——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"“沸腾的乌云翻涌在火焰之中......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"别惊慌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"保护好自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们还有机会，用行动去拯救自己的生命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_9_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“——大地陷入寂静，恐惧取走了他们的声音。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“巨大的源石垂下头颅——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“——坠落，它坠落在死亡焦热的阴影。”"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_9_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————也许他们能自天灾中幸存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"漏网之人，你去处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_4"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然已经想到，整合运动要利用天灾复仇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到，他们居然会选择让天灾彻底毁灭切尔诺伯格——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"比起报复，这更像是宣誓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者的时代......吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"整个天空......都要掉下来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_9_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"清醒点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"保护医生，快带她去安全的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"干员们，各自寻找安全位置！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"各小队！准备好......应对天灾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["？？？"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近卫干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_n